From: pminervini <227357+pminervini@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] MT6750: qualify retained graphics, framebuffer handover, and battery acquisition

Apply after the tablet base through patch 0033 (kernel base 976d4857a991).
Keep simplefb for early boot and load the separately named simpledrm driver only
under the file-lifetime handover controller. No live GPU DVFS or resource release
is introduced. The PMIC acquisition correction preserves real temperature stops.

